# To-Do List App

## Description
A simple To-Do List application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features
- Add tasks
- Delete tasks
- Mark tasks as completed

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## How to Run
1. Download the project
2. Open index.html in browser

